        <p>Chestsrs which would have been a "cert.' Then John .ton, Crease), and Bradshaw combined in artistic tash.ou atd the wing man only failel to score by Inches Fin 1 :—Warriugton. 2 goals, 4 tries (16 point) ; Leigh, 2 Eoals, tries 'lO poitts).</p>
