        <p>iTze competiVo ihuvint been conalude I, Conncillor Steel, a vlce-pre Melt of the aisoci scion, Wag called upov, b Mr. G. Bad, jou., eh &amp;oral, te present the cup to M Mr. STEEL consratulated Mr. Gleare on winning the o m ietition, which he considered was a great honour. He sympathized with Mr. Scott in his cefeat, but con- gratu'ated him on the plucky game he had played.</p>
        <p>THIRD ROUND.</p>
