        <p>A FINE F X IPLE OF A COTTAGE BACK GARDEN, INNER : A. BR UII.IIY, 221, KNUTSFORP-ROAD. This garden which has been awarded a spec,al prize is very tastefully laid out, and contains a good se dal.L.s. The culture of the plahts rtflscts the highest credit upon the owner, and h</p>
